  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "translation": "“奇拉姆的追擊部隊，\n　似乎總算甩掉了！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0000",
      "source_text_sha256": "7789c01a2a23676035dd3308dd956b940fb0eed9298fde98a483b2c14fe0d989",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "7a910f40681415164ab5883b35b05299e5280cb8ba5060acc92c623b733512c8",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“昨天是聯邦軍，今天是奇拉姆……\n　明天會被扎夫特追嗎？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0001",
      "source_text_sha256": "43460f06e0cb100b620bec6c6797ae2b0a9176caea0f6f6881c64b591d8850c3",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3d456462cc7ceca5905ae6e7c2de305829d1870290bc42c3ead343cfb7628d0a",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“別說得這麼悠閒啊！\n　我們好不容易才越過太平洋逃到這裡！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0002",
      "source_text_sha256": "bf41bf9afb87068728ddd4766bff2b31a057ba5cc64b0d5d8f6d503bcb6a7989",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "c7930b3da6933e1b87488273c9d9ec8a6e3eec16dd2640d84d7b4dd27f75376b",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“但是，南阿美利亞幾乎全是荒野。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0003",
      "source_text_sha256": "e70f0004acc53adc7ca3ea1143ecdb67594900c80251a4a1b0667f5961f1d168",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "bf5f7daba87e5ba60cb830f9b3cc8f2697840756ee13f587ed5cfd7251161e6a",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“如果能順利藏好行蹤，\n　應該可以休息一陣。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0004",
      "source_text_sha256": "acb062e9256340fdac804f2c4d127e3c2d847ee50313cc16e8b960fb51ae7b03",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e4da28c19ca6643090000a7933abf829f34f3225405067e2dceeee2056ca9ebf",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“說是一陣，\n　難道這種生活要一直持續下去嗎？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0005",
      "source_text_sha256": "128ee545e4e42cfc87ef4e36b8b33f4de137553c4cb32ed050500f433826d7d7",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "7592b5546f965408bf005df78d2a70c52298961aa262afe110d190394fc8b259",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0006",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e35d01d50ee9551b20c840dbc1b0550fc164b0ca65801fbd374e6e0b2df30a33",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“吵死了，破壞者。\n　不願意就趕緊夾著尾巴滾，\n　自己死在野外吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0007",
      "source_text_sha256": "7dea453a62fcf78f8c4af1844aeb8a651a4dc75ceb235526f71158144c90f68d",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "0d8cfcdd054aa881bdf9909a7b1ca3aac4d6d4c0c9c80b1050b8d9d1a9564f59",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“你說什麼！\n　有本事再說一遍！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0008",
      "source_text_sha256": "cb510306b13dce315dfdc75623062d8677c7545def957b2ad4d706b12432752c",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "be3f70a0502baead287ff8decd80c4d9b83fdb374db5920de5e273c774d5814f",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“等、等一下，小姐！\n　這種時候就別吵架了！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0009",
      "source_text_sha256": "fb31291e4563b1db22be0948401320de71977d4e985d7b83f4ef2c023833e7b1",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "29cd0e4b83b150bf59c4b0ec3711c199d8bd3dd7a5ad182c763808f913f07b8c",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“霍蘭德，你也別找茬。\n　在這種處境下會感到厭煩，\n　也很正常。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0010",
      "source_text_sha256": "6546a28ef67c136b0c3d1bffa49e846d566415e18b2e5df8f7f89eac69c1a12a",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "cdd8f813a7ea69bd15ec1ff48ea6fe0c580a4ebabc326ef3eb1ad14b9f8ad1f6",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0011",
      "source_text_sha256": "f5c01f2f408adae6a02402da45e0fcec477fd33b03c1a21638b4d9cda06611bd",
      "translation": "“嘖……”",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "2dc1e0664b5a7da0bc829728cae716ab73598bd6ada6b861339a5a5c92f390aa",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "（說到底，\n　這些傢伙根本不明白自己的職責。）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0012",
      "source_text_sha256": "32ab9d5d65a39ae43224d4cecd3aeaabc4f7f87b4f4776b6733e8162e78928e1",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "a4caf5220cc1b84f1826a04e86e76f52cd6bffbda7859acdfcfc8f70d8720081",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0013",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e35d01d50ee9551b20c840dbc1b0550fc164b0ca65801fbd374e6e0b2df30a33",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“總之，\n　還得修理各艦。\n　先找個地方落腳吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0014",
      "source_text_sha256": "02fd0b52e5fee6f606798e61cf4deb434acbb8cbf927a3f3cec68bfefd92a458",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "5fff0aad6019f02c5a470d5b207d64f5c53cfb4b8314aa40c4ee911e1ada4838",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“西南30公里處似乎有大型地下洞穴。\n　前往那裡如何？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0015",
      "source_text_sha256": "dc3f514349bc7950825bfc7616b1448b1b34a22f2882359b47818d2d1e603af4",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "cb1703d99324964d4443dab3e90286f27d65da427f653bf6e72c6db2899694e8",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“嗯……在那裡應該能擺脫敵人的追蹤。\n　……霍蘭德也沒意見吧？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0016",
      "source_text_sha256": "b45ad1b964f5309501c28812218dfe2f86e9d967687041c8b37734de7655e797",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "88279dd58a0b9d69c429236cae71d4ee9934cc37344aa6d8043e25c3afdf2e49",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“……不用事事都來問我。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0017",
      "source_text_sha256": "a8bb33a152ae214dc47f20339bcd5f171aa40701295e17b19977f29733d1ad85",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "35bb5f41864ff61dcc7633d8536414ae2da943d63345cf63ebd7348b2f756657",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "translation": "“那麼，前往地下洞穴。\n　各艦不要忘記進行干擾。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "ISSUE-025：补录结构扫描发现的多引用 STAGE 首剧情块。",
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/00.01/0018",
      "source_text_sha256": "e090f9d00f84aeffbd806ec76a092f52a7267960b31b755ecb6dd0530e495b93",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "f4c2ce99d03ffefb7a75bca2877c5636fd786c72279aaee6a172905d59eaa70b",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0000",
      "source_text_sha256": "beef6afa431e042aead7a2e2bc1c3a117a1aebbcbe16bc61a0686c817e00a828",
      "translation": "賢人會議",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3e11ebbf91802bb838b0343fd93391c48660eebf5c5ef4b2b97c02a0816831bf",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0001",
      "source_text_sha256": "beef6afa431e042aead7a2e2bc1c3a117a1aebbcbe16bc61a0686c817e00a828",
      "translation": "賢人會議",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3e11ebbf91802bb838b0343fd93391c48660eebf5c5ef4b2b97c02a0816831bf",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0002",
      "source_text_sha256": "beef6afa431e042aead7a2e2bc1c3a117a1aebbcbe16bc61a0686c817e00a828",
      "translation": "賢人會議",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3e11ebbf91802bb838b0343fd93391c48660eebf5c5ef4b2b97c02a0816831bf",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0003",
      "source_text_sha256": "8c19d33d58b9ffd44d67432a8add50727b4faaadf240142130b9c6fc5756ac9c",
      "translation": "　　　　　〜新地球聯邦本部　賢人會議〜",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-federation",
        "organization/new-earth-federation"
      ],
      "notes": "嵌套词表子串自动例外：organization/earth-federation",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "bcd7b74ed104cf48a13468dc8532a9a9085e6fc1a1090b00b95f3ae3decb8c8a",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0004",
      "source_text_sha256": "7c40f9de3473f684767e32c0ca53a63dbfa62a11087d306d69be17a235d0fc54",
      "translation": "“……奇拉姆拒絕提供時空控制技術？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3e368173d43bdb8a09a87e51ce97131a1777f27f43cb14ee5411c93397cfb010",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0005",
      "source_text_sha256": "59922d5549fba2da0d65fecd8fb15cb12c389ea4a7366cc12eb3c7f1a9e65911",
      "translation": "“嗯……\n　他們似乎打算推進那個D計畫，\n　靠自己的力量修復時空。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "cb662d41fd401e48b99f74fdcedec9f85ae4f8421209ee66db4d04743697b3a8",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0006",
      "source_text_sha256": "e952181b09df2ee726d03f02b4fc87bbe370dd77bc8ed0877ca937961377c7ea",
      "translation": "“換句話說，\n　他們是想按奇拉姆的意願重塑世界嗎……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "5240a4d9b9de8cdc5665f37dd46a6608f8d25e5c7d415ae2c191a3eda522100d",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0007",
      "source_text_sha256": "e6c67e1af83c6ad3df55b67433e23e58ab7d2707382c5435d6a145c30bc85427",
      "translation": "“奇拉姆那幫傢伙……\n　難道還死守著世界崩壞之前的體制不放嗎。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "event/break-the-world",
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "glossary_exceptions": [
        "people/ray"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "705c6c7dc9a841de53e07637a9afe29481555af940690232803606f74300261a",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0008",
      "source_text_sha256": "ad1ee155c909e4615a1e1f7dad40979995ab28a372b7bb4ee31cae3ddecb5da8",
      "translation": "“那是由時空破壞導致時間軸偏移，被提前\n　20年傳送到多元世界的人們建立的國家啊。”",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/multiverse"
      ],
      "notes": "2026-09-20 用户确认：异常位移用“传送”，按上下文保留非自愿位移及动作主语。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "18d5de3dac86399b0109ba3b51b6b9d903b6baddce3ff534f0b5c56e22a7d75a",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0009",
      "source_text_sha256": "3259770617a2b9106a904a13264fbfaa3f9f2661d3029d5f1ba3e91c993235cf",
      "translation": "“聽說它的母體，是與舊地球聯合\n　核心的大西洋聯邦對立的國家。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-alliance"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "423280982001db980572a8ff5057d96c75e8dfd7e8047482b4bdd7eadc98efbc",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0010",
      "source_text_sha256": "b7b88d068b6ff94813812cae6e911508aeb4143209c2e5a7734dd95fc7cd64bb",
      "translation": "“而且，憑藉這20年的優勢，\n　他們擁有我們沒有的時空控制技術。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "a685b0c9098a56e18bef1f43f3f12f26a7290cfe7d3f5aa29289f5dcf047287a",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0011",
      "source_text_sha256": "403cbe9a24ed0d0f356c55eaf6fd4a9c8c2e84cf828de3fe18122f569fe2c22f",
      "translation": "“賈米托夫·海曼！\n　這是你作為談判代表的失職！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "044b8c406907c543cc1d948d085cb2548efa891db922e5c5c7dea2ca4a7dbcce",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0012",
      "source_text_sha256": "22ad1c4fb4658ac63b9ef697ae0366451a5b3f5ecbdb7e481684e6eaa700a176",
      "translation": "“奇拉姆可能會以D計畫為盾牌，\n　逼迫我們屈服！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "b7ffe85149787e9f34fedda6656ea1be1283c1be17e62f8e6f5d6b81b57578be",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0013",
      "source_text_sha256": "e10dc6087319d751a95e64f39ce2fbe003edf2a79bd10cd189fdfa9fde8d9751",
      "translation": "“冷靜點，吉布列。\n　奇拉姆也還沒完成時空控制系統。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram",
        "people/speaker-088d6bffb66a"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：people/speaker-088d6bffb66a。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "640ec99f488baf1217428cdc7bb53b9d29548c5dc71521c0e3163d7ea35f4d71",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0014",
      "source_text_sha256": "1911d6611db8ae37478430ee4842698162a3c8d63d9b8406b9753ce6cbbee39d",
      "translation": "“而且，他們恐怕也沒有\n　把握那系統能完全運作。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "44619e3a195d5226cd31a6c3a3acfcf743b2e8aa2d5db220f5b78e46c054e624",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0015",
      "source_text_sha256": "054e90281781e9da8d2fbdf6a0d736186bb435c7df1e852ec97c1f720b376963",
      "translation": "“根據杜威的報告，\n　奇拉姆和埃曼都在繼續追蹤特異點。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram",
        "organization/emaan",
        "people/speaker-96eedf25cbff",
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：people/speaker-96eedf25cbff。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "997ef9823f4280f9e44da9c1f13d374915e75ef31cab6e3e331e4678c529d440",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0016",
      "source_text_sha256": "53ba657c0af9dd4b64e7565e74be69cf648ff7dade3d21fa70bbf519cc891de8",
      "translation": "“特異點從埃曼叛逃了嗎……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/emaan",
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "29d101576dff82094c6f74a8a525d5667b15b2af466fb1dc32cddbe535576f06",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0017",
      "source_text_sha256": "362678eccb3f2cecff0150a3a53f893be1b18b30750d3f0aa07ccb93f533b4c9",
      "translation": "“怎麼辦？\n　要不要把特異點弄到手作為保險？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "921e1042f7a2712d5cea4da9c6733678ce3584ca951a23286c9b64b397569a07",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0018",
      "source_text_sha256": "fad237ff8c0dce3371e28cf7d21cc40ce1b34898dcdccf5173a44daa1e8a0ea2",
      "translation": "“像捕獲這種畏首畏尾的做法，\n　可能會被奇拉姆或埃曼搶先。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram",
        "organization/emaan"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "74ebb0924d6ac52558d0176c71a7fd2cd95471a955779e1d10d82d880c435fad",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0019",
      "source_text_sha256": "bd88b347c005a04f81c8ab868f429d840963e900dc66504a7888fdd878efe963",
      "translation": "“與其留下後患，\n　不如將其抹殺。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "c118a5a68430984dfb1bd266d07ccd179f0c65c1d602782fea15f266256956ec",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0020",
      "source_text_sha256": "0da1f0cd78dd12a91d61f1abc13d15edfb40589c7bf35ba515dd7516d9a8d03d",
      "translation": "“這也是一個方案……\n　一個看不清大局的凡人，\n　絕不能讓他改變世界……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "2318444ee9ba8e44bd3daaa54737bf3635d99ca1d3f4e422579a13bc96066c0e",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0021",
      "source_text_sha256": "eb425449e31be5f1702989b4245c6833f6f51cb67d0f92f57fafaf59cb72a413",
      "translation": "“因為決定世界走向的，\n　正是這個賢人會議。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "8652c7b479e13004453deef469c2fac25e001a6d1dd824f02f08e4b7ca14fa99",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0022",
      "source_text_sha256": "2832acac4c78cdf49871b0db5cf761f485280d7b03f12f899f2da1f77fe211e5",
      "translation": "“件之極限……\n　那個會破壞多元世界之理的東西，\n　無論如何都必須阻止。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "concept/limit-of-questions",
        "place/multiverse"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：concept/limit-of-questions。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "967fcbca597db3304cb26e22d78f263233b15a50e0aa8de5435769e1ed308559",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0023",
      "source_text_sha256": "059850b83d21b0d248ccf476a87b9107539be11e23de831345ef0580d05d1cd5",
      "translation": "“為了根除它，\n　我們才認可了那個男人的迴歸……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "bae49b0f3df8cae3a8aaf81da83eb9ed299527346b60ab71d16c7eb56b1a77cd",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0024",
      "source_text_sha256": "39e6638d34e0ddaecb1cc4b0332e5f057dc8f11d789627810942963f6a4b0031",
      "translation": "“展翅隊在幹什麼？\n　那個特異點可是和月光州一起行動的。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/ageha-team",
        "technology/singularity",
        "organization/gekkostate"
      ],
      "notes": "全文术语定稿：U:U33。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "f020856026a9362fd672d1718f5f94250c2930a05a1e17ff3e766721a6543923",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0025",
      "source_text_sha256": "cd4371c6ddf8c48b4695de5c04f3a2c8123febd22faa2c0eb9c19e787318eb87",
      "translation": "“趕緊鎖定他們，\n　連同特異點一起處理掉就行了。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "0fb4b268d5332a717fcaa5e1c4a52dc317d3ebedc97a6837ffaecbc5807116d3",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0026",
      "source_text_sha256": "f862617a233d09ec5c48cfb214ed7ef637b4430dcacb154c940f59c37829ca4f",
      "translation": "“別那麼著急。\n　展翅隊的目的可不只是殲滅月光州。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/ageha-team",
        "organization/gekkostate"
      ],
      "notes": "全文术语定稿：U:U33。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "a4e24eab30a01786709474aeb2595f6f60ca455c4c16c7163bfa35dbcea33468",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0027",
      "source_text_sha256": "56a9be8bcdd5d16bb4d79e62cc10ca352c045e6d7bcbf8e0aa8fb1ee1d5d003f",
      "translation": "“但特異點的存在不能忽視。\n　讓杜威上校在推進計畫的同時，\n　也負責捕獲桂木桂這個人。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/kei",
        "people/speaker-96eedf25cbff",
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": "嵌套词表子串自动例外：people/kei；按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：people/speaker-96eedf25cbff。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "b0cb408bc9b95bc06bb56b69152211313baf11a8091597483726be394413da8b",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0028",
      "source_text_sha256": "4c700ded20d8f590c330b68dc14b0c6b3581818f20e0e675cda79e9574d7e1b4",
      "translation": "“當然，如果捕獲困難，\n　也允許抹殺。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "bfe56178d75d994c5544f18f68ca1d2448cb7bb67e10ff1f2c3377cd9e087a31",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0029",
      "source_text_sha256": "dcd89ef9740a43ae05aa9b4219e699264758057ac8f59513542ebe154d9a10dd",
      "translation": "“明白了。\n　我會這樣命令杜威。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/speaker-96eedf25cbff"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：people/speaker-96eedf25cbff。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "9e6911834885ded97b3217214d464cbbec4cc462abd4fc04be5a3aa680ddf94e",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0030",
      "source_text_sha256": "7e11c148fd1ae0f553cfa6f694bf11b322de72c5881feb02dce306cd79ded669",
      "translation": "“他們現在的動向如何？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "66f6abc1eabd357603f34b3ea9965854e640813f3bee9ef554e6f4c129759aa8",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0031",
      "source_text_sha256": "c5751740c1aa9f6cb4538f43674000f7ddd5484e96dc656d1ccad717284b5f39",
      "translation": "“為了躲避埃曼的追蹤，\n　他們逃進了南阿美利亞。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/emaan"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "c78f301872405dca8221eb27ca0e724c42fd57542ddaf10b4036fd81d8310e04",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0032",
      "source_text_sha256": "449e7776163064fac4106aaf36c40a8ded45c06b062c381095424821cce1a7dc",
      "translation": "“南阿美利亞嗎……\n　逃進法外之地，\n　倒是老鼠會幹的事。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "d788b49cfd87fc9029f0280a4eb6bf6109b9a078736a3fcfedaef8dd7ec41044",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0033",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e35d01d50ee9551b20c840dbc1b0550fc164b0ca65801fbd374e6e0b2df30a33",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0034",
      "source_text_sha256": "0008bc77ffe8a9def6cb9870cc85623f5980f9d45277b8f0b0e1bd4a13d92437",
      "translation": "“而且，不配合地球聯邦的\n　奇拉姆只是礙事的存在。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram",
        "organization/earth-federation"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e8a320b77eb7b4c63d1db7d631d9ee7e82d88a1468c95089e6b5b90f528ad0bb",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0035",
      "source_text_sha256": "74273f9934301637f6191f5467aba3021674fd2f300d4a50a0aa18e028e23ecf",
      "translation": "“這是個好機會，\n　就把那臺機體投入到對奇拉姆的戰鬥中吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "46f99033d1b9b89ca54b5d6cbb041463a0808f4950cf7baa5b5e5261c5765ede",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0036",
      "source_text_sha256": "2ae9b3d0b44f0d3c099f6dee1e4f0c626529eb0f5173d4772d90fb79389c245c",
      "translation": "“請等一下。\n　在這個時機進攻奇拉姆，\n　沒有任何好處。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "72b4d6baf991647d0b5aa17d5348588b0248e14d28f4783bd9f691406b30ae80",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0037",
      "source_text_sha256": "86c844c39363d26c8f18b6e071c9b0b55c7bd39253278750285ff64197232228",
      "translation": "“如果他們有自己的時空修復方案，\n　我們應該互相拿出計畫，\n　探討阻止世界崩潰的最佳方法。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "82f8aa4a0ba509b777f62d2ba175df76f0d57a36a8b0368f38d39dd42eb113b6",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0038",
      "source_text_sha256": "faf11633ddabfa458e058a768fbe16024774a5df80fd4b338cfa3aac20704ff4",
      "translation": "“安戴爾准將……\n　那件事交給特異點或展翅隊去做就行了。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/ageha-team",
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": "全文术语定稿：U:U33。\n删除模型响应串行化尾部污染。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "2726248b1b8926f233dd4b667f6e6379710058734f1ecafe6e219c5cd8b3eb54",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0039",
      "source_text_sha256": "d58b37a193710a5948334b7e4f3717ce56875b342a391e238b80b9728819af27",
      "translation": "“我們應該考慮的，\n　已經是下一個階段了。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "c9af6cb057c1f71a3757d0da319e1b50c66489edbd8ab7f15b580fd6536957ae",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0040",
      "source_text_sha256": "9c8ac8b27e16b2840ed9fc839dd33c69d0c7530c31977faf38f3e2376b3265ce",
      "translation": "“這怎麼行……\n　世界一旦崩潰，\n　一切都會歸於虛無啊。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "facf95ad5b2bb5fd32cabaf398d238936af9aef584afa03b6478ace5ddcc02d6",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0041",
      "source_text_sha256": "5b59a98c8ef591bbd19fed3774d0ec7a8bd68689a0e65b4b1799107227c7b4eb",
      "translation": "“注意你的言辭，安戴爾·貝魯那魯……！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/edel-bernal"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "0cd1f7e2d25d0b641ac0a3c6b35e29dbcf4a59f98836163689c01671bc0c83b1",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0042",
      "source_text_sha256": "c2e59d1b7fba737101a3c34360aa90b3509d4bc34698a68ff4f297bcce1a32be",
      "translation": "“賈米托夫總帥說得對。\n　這個賢人會議，\n　是為了統御多元世界而存在的。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/multiverse"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "52460a9b2347dba82ca8c782863e2e47e04ea174cc04cec038c29c390dd01ff3",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0043",
      "source_text_sha256": "0d4fcf3c0c2e8407a9d4e2179357f0c083a77a752a1821ce3b116edd8e35e570",
      "translation": "“雖然你只是末席，\n　但讓你參加是看中UN的貢獻。\n　要認清自己的身份。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "system/un-network"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "9814480c646c52a1f8b5ce3431a91b67a4bdf2fd3c8a3e46bfcb64d2fc7fc11b",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0044",
      "source_text_sha256": "fe5257bef6b55a5aeb27d92c2fdeabc38d3af2dfbdbc669184eed16b779afb98",
      "translation": "“……是。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e7dcde66076142948d3b98a02f009dca01c98d85950fd92f0c1edc4c56c04b74",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0045",
      "source_text_sha256": "c255c6fe1c5df1a1a6d49dfbb19f994ffbfd469f2f0aeaa95f1b00c950445a10",
      "translation": "（哼……以LOGOS的經濟實力為\n　後盾的賢人會議，終究只是裝飾……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/speaker-539973d146a5"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：people/speaker-539973d146a5。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "e2d97d8614382f17c27cd3e38a15845a93762d93407bcd8b98750b9d9dd3e179",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0046",
      "source_text_sha256": "7d9ef3de34da541e244daebda4c801148c3bae47b721efd193c7491706800365",
      "translation": "（總有一天，\n　也要讓這些老傢伙們明白這一點……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3169542c4d7cb60cbc0232d6d929cbbd3adc55d4be273e164e4831949a01e683",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0047",
      "source_text_sha256": "668bbbd47b64197d2dc7473861b6a548b604dd7dee3a25830f3f1f4779583318",
      "translation": "“這個世界不會毀滅。\n　而且，統御世界、引導人類走向更好方向，\n　是我們的職責。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "7decd89071fdc9397e9b1474592241e454ae7a8794d66f8ac2918815b68efa26",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0048",
      "source_text_sha256": "8d970bfb0c4809f9e40b640e5c4ced2b45359c846be66888f86988f15063a7a8",
      "translation": "“絕不能把這個世界交給杜蘭朵之流。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/durandal"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3de42057e073e03642e10c626128c6cf01963145d01c635921c519d301879f36",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0049",
      "source_text_sha256": "aad5a4355392a03e3ae46cae18efe6797f2eb14883d790e6e447f15ebd1a6413",
      "translation": "（被眼前利益束縛的人，\n　沒有預見未來的能力……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "3551e6592cc1b03febc19ddbcf2d4af5ead5af7d6fdf7e1267dcfb6ce4569371",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/081/dialogue/01.01/0050",
      "source_text_sha256": "1cbab45b183c4b1ec780cacfe0c0603844013aac0a8b58b5c6811d45f95430d6",
      "translation": "（也許，坐在這裡的人才是將\n　世界封閉於黑暗的元兇……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "",
